  "de:16": "A night of Catholic glamour and grace, honoring the youths who have used their ten talents to light up the world. A grand finale event recognizing the top contributors from all other categories. This does not mean the glory is given to the vessels rather than the maker but to tell the vessels that they can keep doing well to the greater glory of Christ and His body the church.",
