  "de:18": "A search for the best vocalists and choirs within the Catholic Church to recognize, encourage and award them and to equip them further in order to serve the purpose of the liturgy as well as their personal dreams-whether those who want to make a living from this or purely from just passion and service. Aim includes elevating the standard of liturgical music by celebrating the voices that lead our hearts to heaven every Sunday and outside to encourage pious devotions and individual inculturated songs and worship.",
