  "de:170": "Our mission is to reach out to Catholic youths in Nigeria, Africa and maybe the world at large and make them feel loved, cherished, encouraged and valued. We intend to extend our care to their personal life goals, dreams and passions, especially those of them who are gifted and passionate about a particular endeavour and to help them achieve those dreams. We also intend to encourage those using their gifts in service of the faith by recognising their efforts through awards and other empowerment programs.",
